<title>CHINA: China Agricultural Bank int'l deals up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>China Agricultural Bank int'l deals up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of international settlements by the Agricultural Bank of China rose a year-on-year 12 percent in the January-November period of 1996, the Financial News said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The newspaper gave no more details.</p>
</text>
